+/*
+ * Perform dequantization and inverse DCT on one block of coefficients,
+ * producing a reduced-size 3x3 output block.
+ *
+ * Optimized algorithm with 2 multiplications in the 1-D kernel.
+ * cK represents sqrt(2) * cos(K*pi/6).
+ */
