+/*
+ * Perform dequantization and inverse DCT on one block of coefficients,
+ * producing a 9x9 output block.
+ *
+ * Optimized algorithm with 10 multiplications in the 1-D kernel.
+ * cK represents sqrt(2) * cos(K*pi/18).
