+ */
+
+/*
+ * This code is loosely based on ppmtogif from the PBMPLUS distribution
+ * of Feb. 1991.  That file contains the following copyright notice:
+ *    Based on GIFENCODE by David Rowley <mgardi@watdscu.waterloo.edu>.
